---
const linkClass = "text-primary-accent underline underline-offset-4 hover:no-underline";
---

<section class="mx-auto max-w-2xl px-4 pb-24 text-center">
	<h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">Still have questions?</h2>
	<p class="text-muted-foreground mt-4 text-pretty">
		Read over our <a href="/enrollment-information" class={linkClass}>enrollment page</a>, <a
			href="/our-approach"
			class={linkClass}>our approach</a
		>, or <a href="/who-we-are" class={linkClass}>who we are</a> — and if those still don't answer
